glean follows fzf (https://github.com/junegunn/fzf) by Junegunn Choi:
its extended-search query syntax, v1 and v2 matching behavior, scoring
constants, Latin-letter folding data, default layout, key bindings,
color names, and spinner frames. glean was developed from descriptions
of fzf behavior and comparison of filter results. This does not establish
that every implementation detail or data element is independently derived.

